       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ITEMREP.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT KSDSRT-FILE ASSIGN TO DD1
               ORGANIZATION IS indexed
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               RECORD KEY IS KSDS-ITMNO
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DD2
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  REPORT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS REPORT-REC.
       01  REPORT-REC    PIC X(080).
       FD  KSDSRT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS KSDSRT-REC.
       COPY KSDSRP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ITM-REC.
           05  WS-ITMNO     PIC X(05).
           05  FILLER       PIC X.
           05  WS-ITMNAME   PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER       PIC X.
           05  WS-PRICE     PIC 9(5).
           05  FILLER       PIC X.
           05  WS-QNT       PIC 9(03).
           05  FILLER       PIC X(54).
       01  WS-PAGE-COUNT       PIC 9(03) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-REC-IN-PAGE      PIC 9(03) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TOTAL-QNT        PIC 9(03) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-PAGE-QNT         PIC 9(03) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TOTAL-PRICE      PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-PAGE-PRICE       PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-END-FILE         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-PAGE-PRICE-EDIT    PIC Z(10).99.
       01  WS-TOTAL-PRICE-EDIT   PIC Z(10).99.
       01  WS-PRICE-EDIT         PIC Z(8).99.
       01  WS-FILE-STATUS   PIC XX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT  KSDSRT-FILE
           OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-END-FILE = 'Y'
              READ KSDSRT-FILE
                 AT END
                 MOVE 'Y' TO WS-END-FILE
                 NOT AT END
                 MOVE KSDSRT-REC TO WS-ITM-REC
                 PERFORM WRITE-DETAIL
              END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           PERFORM WRITE-FOOTER

           CLOSE REPORT-FILE KSDSRT-FILE
           STOP RUN.

       WRITE-DETAIL.
           IF WS-REC-IN-PAGE = 0
              PERFORM WRITE-HEADER
           END-IF
           MOVE WS-PRICE        TO WS-PRICE-EDIT

           STRING WS-ITMNO DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  '  ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-ITMNAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  '    ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-QNT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  '   ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-PRICE-EDIT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO REPORT-REC
           END-STRING
           WRITE REPORT-REC

           ADD 1 TO WS-REC-IN-PAGE
           ADD WS-QNT   TO WS-TOTAL-QNT
           ADD WS-QNT   TO WS-PAGE-QNT
           ADD WS-PRICE TO WS-TOTAL-PRICE
           ADD WS-PRICE TO WS-PAGE-PRICE

           IF WS-REC-IN-PAGE >= 6
              PERFORM WRITE-FOOTER
              MOVE 0 TO WS-REC-IN-PAGE
              MOVE 0 TO WS-PAGE-QNT
              MOVE 0 TO WS-PAGE-PRICE
           END-IF.

       WRITE-HEADER.
           ADD 1 TO WS-PAGE-COUNT
           MOVE '*** ITEM RECORD REPORT ***' TO REPORT-REC
           WRITE REPORT-REC
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-REC
           MOVE 'ITM-ID NAME          QUANTITY  PRICE'
                                    to     REPORT-REC
           WRITE REPORT-REC.

       WRITE-FOOTER.
           MOVE WS-TOTAL-PRICE   TO WS-TOTAL-PRICE-EDIT
           STRING 'PAGE:' WS-PAGE-COUNT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                ' RECORDS:' WS-REC-IN-PAGE DELIMITED BY SIZE
                ' QUANTITY:' WS-TOTAL-QNT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                ' TOTAL PRICE:' WS-TOTAL-PRICE-EDIT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                INTO REPORT-REC
           END-STRING
           WRITE REPORT-REC
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-REC
           WRITE REPORT-REC.

